## Testing Requirements

1. Test in at least 2 color schemes (modern + light)
2. Test at 100% and 200% zoom
3. Test RTL layout
4. Verify focus states are visible
5. Check WCAG AA contrast (4.5:1 text, 3:1 UI)

## Commit Guidelines

- Keep patches small and focused on one component
- Each patch should be independently revertable
- Include before/after screenshots in PR descriptions
- Reference the requirements doc for that component

